        P4_6["4.6 Pricing Strategy<br/>(CreatorJourney.Phase4Data.PricingStrategy)<br/>• 13 Supported Revenue Models<br/>• Unit Economics & Floor Formulas<br/>• ConfiguredTaxMode (No crude B2B/B2C)<br/>• 4-Price Independence"]
        P4_7["4.7 GTM & Launch Strategy<br/>(CreatorJourney.Phase4Data.GtmStrategy)<br/>• Primary Launch Segment & ICP<br/>• Channel Mix & Load Caps<br/>• Strict Budget Safety (Awarded vs Planned)<br/>• Validation Experiments & Stop Rules"]
        P4_8["4.8 Launch Assets<br/>(APPROVED ARCHITECTURE ONLY)<br/>• One-Page Branded Launch Website<br/>• Section Families (Hero, Solution, Pricing)<br/>• LaunchAssetVersions (Pending)"]
        P4_9["4.9 Construction Readiness<br/>(RESERVED / NOT IMPLEMENTED)<br/>• Final Global Launch Certification"]

        P4_1 -->|Snapshot Gaps| P4_2
